  data: {
    LLM: "Void suits early to smear high-value cards (Ace and Ten) onto opponents.\n\nManage your trumps carefully. If you have low trumps, use them to win 'cheap' tricks so you don't have to take expensive ones later.\n\nThe 'March': If you have extremely high cards, you might try to win every single trick, which can sometimes result in a special bonus or clearing multiple strokes.",
